/Title (Disaggregating the macro trend reveals distinct cross-border mechanics across the 4 pillars. The Italian market undergoes a sharp early structural contraction in the Inclusion baseline, followed by an exponential late-stage surge inside the Mind vertical post-2023. Conversely, the US market retains its dominant volume anchor in performance-centric metrics \(Body\), while exhibiting an acute, massive volumetric search velocity spike within the Spirit pillar peaking in 2024, validating a clear portfolio diversification mandate for the client.)
