1081 0 obj
<<
/Title (Granular monthly tracking proves that wellness engagement operates independently from traditional fitness cycles. Peak search volumes consistently align with periods of elevated cognitive stress across a verified index scale ranging from 29.47 to 59.61. While Italy demonstrates an immediate, powerful engagement window during the autumn return transition \(September to October, Q3/Q4\), acting as a resilient anti-cyclical demand buffer, traditional performance models \(World A\) experience severe contractions during the summer break, bottoming out in August across both geographic cohorts before experiencing a robust, stress-driven Q3/Q4 recovery wave.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1068 0 R
>>
