/Title (Our custom-calculated Inclusivity Gap Ratio isolates the exact velocity shift between performance and holistic intent. The data highlights a critical cross-border divergence: while the Italian market acts as the primary velocity driver with an early structural contraction, the US market exhibits a more stable, linear trajectory governed by high baseline capacity. Both geographical tracks reached a major structural Trend Convergence pivot between late 2022 and early 2023, which permanently consolidated into a new operational market baseline by 2024.)
